{"code":"261200","name":"덴티스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리장비와용품","sector_desc":"의료기기·진단기기·의료용품. 수출 비중이 높고 인허가와 해외 판매 성과가 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2005년 설립, 2020년 코스닥에 상장한 치과용 의료기기 전문 기업임. 치과용 임플란트를 주력으로 의료용 조명등, 치과용 3D프린터, 바이오 제품을 개발·판매하고 있으며, 국내는 직접, 해외는 딜러 및 현지법인을 통해 판매함. 매년 매출의 6% 이상을 R&D에 투자, 신제품 지속 출시하며, 2024년 스마트클린 팩토리를 설립하여 Dental Medical Total Solution 기업으로 성장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":2440.0,"open":2400.0,"high":2485.0,"low":2370.0,"volume":17118,"amount":41767920.0,"ret_1d":2.521,"gap":0.8403,"range_pct":4.7131,"ret_5":-2.2044,"ret_20":-6.5134,"ret_60":-2.7888,"ret_120":-38.3838,"ret_250":-51.9685,"ma20":2560.25,"ma60":2580.0833,"ma120":2750.7083,"ma200":3273.0,"close_vs_ma200":-25.4507,"close_vs_ma60":-5.4294,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-12.2238,"r2_60":0.0422,"slope_120":-46.758,"r2_120":0.4148,"slope_250":-54.8677,"r2_250":0.8645,"high52":5150.0,"low52":2125.0,"pos_52w":10.4132,"dd_52w":-52.6214,"mdd_1y":-54.4643,"atr14_pct":8.1674,"vol_ann_60":42.9491,"vol_avg20":15197.8,"vol_ratio20":1.1263,"vr5":0.2615,"vr20":0.3043,"amount_avg5":29235709.0,"amount_avg20":38832583.25,"amount_avg60":122111463.8333,"obv_chg20":15.3081,"turnover_20":1.9226,"pv_eff_20":-3.3878,"rsi14":41.8836,"frgn_net_5":4847.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0307,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0307,"frgn_net_20":16124.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.102,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.102,"frgn_net_60":-139233.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.8807,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.8807,"frgn_net_120":-84825.0,"inst_net_120":-100440.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.5365,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.6353,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.1718,"foreign_ratio":3.43,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.97,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":26.0,"op_margin_q":8.0997,"op_qoq":-16.129,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":966.6667,"rev_yoy":-0.9259,"op_trend_4q":59.8817,"fin_period":"202606","roe":2.5,"debt_ratio":281.25,"per":27.42,"pbr":0.